  "sourceAssignment": "Completion 159 Across exclusively owns the full across-part1 original family: navigation/entry, initial rule and actor staging, the failed eight-input BABA IS MOVE launch, 34 undos, the mistimed KEKE IS YOU attempt with both Kekes disappearing, one undo, two waits, the successful simultaneous belt rotation and complete flag finish. All five original/sidecar files remain retained. Unfinished Stardrop and later map-survey sources are separate; no other record shares this source.",
